+/*
+ * Copyright (C) 2025 O‌ute‌rTu‌ne Project
+ *
+ * Discord rich presence adapted from reocat/OuterTune (GPL-3.0), rebuilt with OuterTune's own
+ * settings components. See git history for contributors.
