From f2b088e8753f4816979363dc132033303a8b4213 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 10:19:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/31] Let the stats charts rank by plays or by time

A chip row above the charts switches songs and artists together between
time listened and number of plays. They genuinely disagree - a long track
played twice beats a short one played ten times on time and loses on
count - and neither is the right answer for everyone.

One query each rather than two, with the measure chosen in an ORDER BY
CASE. Both columns come from the same aggregate, so switching costs a
re-sort rather than a second pass over the events table.
